//
// Independent replacement for zstd's excluded build/VS2010/libzstd-dll/libzstd-dll.rc
// (outside the reviewed source profile). zstd's CMake adds that script to its
// shared library under MSVC-compatible compilers; upstream it only carries a
// version-information resource. The Windows dependency recipe places this file
// at that path in its work copy of the snapshot (the snapshot is unchanged). It
// defines no resources: the DLL's behaviour does not depend on them.
